{"id":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior-uncond","title":"lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior-uncond","path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.md","line":1326,"body":"","kind":"lemma","status":"not_started","tex":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.tex#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior-uncond","uses":["[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior]]","[[references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods.tex","label":"lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior-uncond","line":3500,"source":"\\begin{lemma}[minimizing geodesics with interior in the ball --- unconditional]\n  \\label{lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior-uncond}\n\n  \\uses{lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior, lem:dc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound}\n\n  \\dcref{ch3:4.2}\n  There is $\\beta>0$ such that any $q_1,q_2\\in\\overline{B_\\beta(p)}$ are joined by a \\emph{minimizing}\n  geodesic ($d(\\gamma(s),\\gamma(t))=|s-t|\\,d(q_1,q_2)$) whose open arc lies in $\\overline{B_\\beta(p)}$.\n  The lower-bound hypothesis in \\cref{lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior} is supplied by\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound}; hence this gives the existence, minimizing, and interior\n  clauses of strong convexity (\\cref{def:dc-ch3-4-2-stronglyconvex}).\n\\end{lemma}\n\\begin{proof}\n  \\sketch\n\n  Apply the lower-bound lemma \\cref{lem:dc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound} to the reduction\n  \\cref{lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior}.\n\\end{proof}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Lemma</div></section>[minimizing geodesics with interior in the ball --- unconditional] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368332d342d322d6d696e696d697a696e672d696e746572696f722d756e636f6e64\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound\">↗ lem:dc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound</a> <p></p><span class=\"tex-source-references\" role=\"list\" style=\"display:block\"><span class=\"tex-dcref\" role=\"listitem\" style=\"display:block\">1. ch3:4.2</span></span>There is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\beta &gt;0$\">$\\beta &gt;0$</span> such that any <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$q_1,q_2\\in \\overline{B_\\beta (p)}$\">$q_1,q_2\\in \\overline{B_\\beta (p)}$</span> are joined by a <em>minimizing</em> geodesic (<span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$d(\\gamma (s),\\gamma (t))=|s-t|\\, d(q_1,q_2)$\">$d(\\gamma (s),\\gamma (t))=|s-t|\\, d(q_1,q_2)$</span>) whose open arc lies in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\overline{B_\\beta (p)}$\">$\\overline{B_\\beta (p)}$</span>. The lower-bound hypothesis in <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368332d342d322d6d696e696d697a696e672d696e746572696f72\">section 3</a> is supplied by <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368332d342d322d6c6f776572626f756e64\">section 3</a>; hence this gives the existence, minimizing, and interior clauses of strong convexity (<a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23def%3Adc-ch3-4-2-stronglyconvex\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#def:dc-ch3-4-2-stronglyconvex\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6465663a64632d6368332d342d322d7374726f6e676c79636f6e766578\">section 3</a>).  <section class=\"theorem proof\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Proof</div><p>\\sketch </p><p>Apply the lower-bound lemma <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-lowerbound\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368332d342d322d6c6f776572626f756e64\">section 3</a> to the reduction <a class=\"reference tex-ref\" href=\"#node=references%2FDoCarmo%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2FCh03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods%23lem%3Adc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior\" data-tex-node=\"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-minimizing-interior\" data-tex-anchor=\"tex-label-6c656d3a64632d6368332d342d322d6d696e696d697a696e672d696e746572696f72\">section 3</a>. </p><span class=\"qed\" aria-label=\"证毕\" style=\"display:block;text-align:right\">□</span></section>","warnings":["部分 TeX 排版细节未完整还原（已保留可读内容）: sketch"]},"previous":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-stronglyconvex-reduction","next":"references/DoCarmo/blueprint/src/chapters/Ch03_GeodesicsConvexNeighborhoods#lem:dc-ch3-4-2-stronglyconvex-uniq","relations":[{"kind":"